    ("jamb_eng_2013_11", "English Language", "Cloze: Hydrogen Bomb", "2013", "It should therefore be classified with certain rare natural …11… [A. programmes B. occurrences C. resources D. laws]", "programmes", "occurrences", "resources", "laws", 1, "Atmospheric disturbances include rare catastrophic physical 'occurrences' like volcanic eruptions."),
