    ("jamb_eng_2013_43", "English Language", "Sentence Interpretation", "2013", "‘I can’t wait to become a mother,’ the new bride declared.", "She sees motherhood as a burden", "She is excited about motherhood.", "She is not keen on becoming a mother", "She will be patient as a mother.", 1, "'Can't wait' expresses intense joyful anticipation and eagerness."),
